#X text 240 168 The @curve property controls the shape of the mapping
(following the SuperCollider convention): 0 gives a linear response
\, values less than 0 give a convex curve (exponential-like: rises
slowly at first and faster toward the upper end of the range) \, and
values greater than 0 give a concave curve (logarithmic-like: rises
quickly at first and slower toward the upper end).;
